  "design": {
    "idea": "Terminal Orbit (ASTONISHING): light Star 1 on the abyss lip, throw your lantern tangentially into Well 1 (Apogee Clasp + Starlight Sextant!) to bridge around the tumbling stone arch to Star 2, cross to the center slab, clear the Satellite Eye, flip Well 2 to Push, and curve a shot around Well 2 to light Star 3 and ring the far Star Bell locking the final bridge.",
    "kind": "setpiece",
    "beat": "ten",
    "teaches": "Full mid-fall synthesis of Apogee Clasp orbiting lantern, Starlight Sextant portable star vertex, polarity flip, and Star Bell bridge locking.",
    "decisions": 9,
    "expert_s": 60,
    "reward": "fall_r3_latch+roof_descent",
    "why": "Astonishing climax traversal room of the Fall set piece fusing Dungeon A + B powers.",
    "exit": "exit_fl_r3_e",
